        <b>Type:</b> Ancient Mine, Quarry or other Industry <b>County/Region:</b> Murcia <br /> Pos Accuracy: <b>5</b> Condition: <b>4</b> (5 is best)   Ambience: <b>3</b>  Access: <b>3</b>  (5 is best)<br />
                    <b>Lat:</b> 38.26467 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Long</b>: -0.8254213<img src="http://www.megalithic.co.uk/a558/a312/gallery/Portugal/Spain/thumb/xefd_IMG_1924.jpg" align="right" valign="top"></a>
<br />
                    A renovated Aqueduct from the Islamic era at the feet of a mountain range north of Crevillent. The road is quite narrow. Though there is housing along the road and some small villages up in the mounta...<b>.</b> (c) Meg. Portal contributors.<br />
